<headline>FINAL PRICING -- Botetourt County IDA, Va.</headline>
<text>
<p>IDA OF BOTETOURT COUNTY, VIRGINIA</p>
<p>RE: $5,000,000 LEASE  REVENUE NOTES</p>
<p>SCHOOL CONSTRUCTION PROJECT</p>
<p>SEREIS 1997</p>
<p>BANK QUALIFIED</p>
<p>WRITTEN AWARD.</p>
<p>Trade date will be today, 6/17/97.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NR		    S&amp;P: NR</p>
